\item[S2] Andrej Dujella, Diophantine m-tuples, author-maintained survey (snapshot accessed 9 October 2026), Section 5.2, paragraph on rational sextuples and the unknown septuple. \url{https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dujella/dujella.github.io/master/ratio.html}.
